{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*dāvàti}}. {{surf|ru|дать|-ва́ть}}. Cognate with {{cog|uk|дава́ти||to give}}, {{cog|be|дава́ць||to give}}, {{cog|bg|давам||I give}} (imperfective), {{cog|sh|да́вати}}, {{m|sh|dávati}}, {{cog|pl|dawać||to give}}.

